From bc0d0ee93d3d76b686dc15b5237e07cde6c0a96b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:00:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add a file-backed V2 UTXO snapshot and undo log

Persist the incremental UTXO set as a versioned checksummed snapshot plus
one undo record per batch. Reopen recomputes the same root. Undoing the
last record restores the previous root. A truncated record fails closed.
lotusd does not call this store, and no V2 block is accepted.
